Read the runtime root requests through SafeList.items() (applied by relative_oracle.py after A0)

Upstream made CheckedArtifact's root_requests.runtime_requests a
collections.SafeList, so A0's devObjectHashes no longer compiled
("expected type '[]const checked_artifact.RootRequest', found
'safe_list.SafeList(checked_artifact.RootRequest)'"). The line now reads
the requests the way upstream's own lowerCheckedRoot does. Applies after
0003-object-file-args.patch.

